No. Conditions (a) not take undue advantage of liberty or misuse liberty;
(b) not act in a manner injuries to the interest of the prosecution;
R/CR.MA/6827/2023 ORDER DATED: 21/06/2023 (c) surrender passport, if any, to the lower court within a week;
(d) not leave India without prior permission of the Sessions Judge concerned;
